.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH notifications 1  "notifications " 
.SH NAME
notifications \- List and manage your notifications
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBnotifications\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List and manage your notifications
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
notifications\-list(1)
List notifications (default when no subcommand is given)
.TP
notifications\-read(1)
Mark one notification (or all of them) as read
.TP
notifications\-delete(1)
Delete one notification
.TP
notifications\-count(1)
Print the unread count
.TP
notifications\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
